	(text "TPS26600, MODE open: circuit breaker I(CB) 1.30-1.61 A (RILIM 8.06k 1 %, eq. 4 + table 7.5), 4 ms, 540 ms\nauto-retry; factory UVLO 15 V / OVP 32.6 V (UVLO, OVP to RTN); SHDN open = on (self-biased 2.7 V).\ndVdT 680n (CSR-03): 0.13-0.23 V/ms, 26.4 V in 115-208 ms; 600 uF draws <= 0.137 A, so start-up <= 1.14 A per\nport and 4.55 A for four (SYS +24V_GD limit >= 4.69 A). Start-up dissipation <= 6.7 W (resistive-load\nmodel, eq. 22-24) vs SLVSDG2G figure 55 at 85 C (graph reading, not verified). Asserted on every build.\nA shorted cell cable trips only its own eFuse. A PTC was rejected: MF-MSMF110 holds only 0.73 A at 60 C."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 119.368 80.98 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "043668a2-6e24-5935-b0d4-792d2fa93daa")
	)
	(text "Pin map = interfaces.CELL. Pins 1-2 carry +24V_GD only (gate-driver bias, channel B switched).\nNTC_N returns to AGND here; FLT/EN pairs go to the trip sheet."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 89.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1c28f591-a9e1-50b6-846e-e6e81805875d")
	)
	(text "RDY, ID, NTC"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 473.2 118.06 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3a7e6c3f-0096-5468-843b-1e4bcddb71bb")
	)
	(text "RDY: push-pull from the power board (PVCELL-25 rev B, DAB-D60 rev B: LVC1G17, Ioff = high impedance when\nunpowered) or open drain with its own pull-up; the 100k pull-down here reads not-ready when the cable is\nunplugged or the board unpowered (INT-14). Levels asserted on every build; 1k/1 nF (1 us) filter into the\nGPIO and the driver-enable AND. ID: 10.0k from VBIAS (2.5 V), decode table in the pin plan (MUX_OUT).\nNTC (floating pair): 10.0k from VBIAS, 10k NTC reads 1.25 V at 25 C."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 473.2 179.612 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3e2b8dc0-9afe-5832-9ffc-26a9b0ce3c39")
	)
	(text "PWMk (1 = switch on) -> RS-422 pair, terminated on the power board. 10k pull-downs: ePWM balls are\ninputs without pull-up during reset/boot (table 6-6), so every gate command is 0 until firmware runs.\nG = C3_DRV_EN, G~ high: outputs high impedance unless CHB_OK, C3_EN_MCU and RDY are high (INT-15).\nePWM9-12 have no high-resolution PWM: buck-boost cells only, not a DAB bridge."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 262.176 105.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4aacfa05-6db6-57c3-92fc-f3ad67381118")
	)
	(text "ANALOG FRONT ENDS AN1-AN3 (OPA4388), DUAL RANGE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 118.06 0)
		(effects
